Personal Fork Notice
--------------------
This is a personal Rockbox fork maintained for use on my personal iPod Mini
2G. It is not an official Rockbox distribution.

The fork currently adds adjustable iPod Mini 2G backlight brightness from 1
to 100 using software PWM.

It also supports a tagcache update marker: creating
`/.rockbox/tagcache_update.pending` requests one database update after
Rockbox starts, even when automatic updates are disabled. The marker is
removed only after a successful update.

Development of this fork uses agentic AI tooling: OpenAI ChatGPT using
GPT-5.6 Luna.

